# 📅 Day 1 — Introduction to JavaScript

## 🧠 Topics Covered

- What is JavaScript?
- Role of JavaScript in Web Development
- How JavaScript works with HTML & CSS
- Internal vs External JavaScript
- Using `<script>` tag
- Writing first JavaScript code
- Console Output

## 📘 Explanation

JavaScript is a programming language used to make websites interactive. It can change website content, respond to user actions, validate forms, and create dynamic features.

## 💻 Practice Code

